# DAX Expressions

## Attrition Count

```DAX
Attrition Count =
CALCULATE(
    COUNTROWS(Employee),
    Employee[Attrition] = "Yes"
)
Total Employees =
COUNTROWS(Employee)
Attrition Rate =
DIVIDE(
    [Attrition Count],
    [Total Employees],
    0
)
Average Years at Company =
AVERAGE(Employee[YearsAtCompany])
